    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n“Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\nA well presented top-floor one-bedroom apartment, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Brooklawns development.\nBoasting a desirable south-facing aspect, the apartment enjoys excellent natural light throughout the day, creating a bright, warm and inviting living environment. The well-proportioned accommodation offers a stylish open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, a generous sized double bedroom, and a contemporary bathroom.\nSituated in this sought after locality, residents benefit from a sense of privacy and exclusivity, while the property's top-floor position provides an elevated outlook and a peaceful setting.\nIdeally positioned within walking distance of Sligo Town Centre, Finisklin Business Park, Bus and Train Services, and a wide range of local amenities, \nAn excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a contemporary quality home, this superb apartment combines modern living, privacy and an enviable location.\nAnnual service charge including sinking fund contribution 914.\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.8m x 4.6m\nwooden flooringpatio door to sounth facing balcony\n\nKitchen - 2.2m x 2m\ngood range of wall and floor units\n\nBedroom - 4.2m x 2.9m\nfitted wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.8m\nBath, wc, whb fully tiled\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Double glazed timber windows</li><li>Sizeable balcony with sunny aspect</li><li>Car parking on site</li><li>Lift and stair access</li><li>Managed communal services including refuse and insurance</li><li>Convenient to all amenities</ul>"
      },
      {
